8","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-03T17:38:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T18:58:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exporting an unsigned integer field in C#, it is possible to assign a negative value to it in the inspector. I expected the inspector wouldn't let me do that, or make all negative values zero. But instead it just accepts it. When the negative value is printed to the console, it converts a value of -1 to 4294967295. There are no errors or warnings for this behaviour.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a C# script, and add this:\n\n```\n[Export] uint value;\n\npublic override void _Ready()\n{\n    GD.Print(value);\n}\n```\n\nAdd the script to a new node in a scene, and build the project. \n\nIt is now possible to set the uint value to a negative value in the inspector.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[uint-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20024338/uint-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106060/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}